  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: Turkish
    Text: "Liderlik tablosunu a\xE7mak i\xE7in giri\u015F yapman\u0131z gerekir.
      Giri\u015F yapmak istiyor musunuz?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: To open the leaderboard you need to log in. Do you want to log in?
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
